+// Camoufox: how much later than a connection with no proxy this one hears
+// from its peer: the handshake up to the CONNECT request, and a round trip to
+// the proxy for that request and its reply, and one more for a ClientHello
+// that waits for the reply. Until the request is sent, the time the handshake
+// has taken so far (HappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt::RelayLag).
+mozilla::TimeDuration nsSOCKSSocketInfo::Lost() const {
+  if (mBegan.IsNull()) {
